1
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Enter into his gates with thanksgiving, and into his courts with praise: be thankful unto him, and bless his name.
Psalm 100:4 (KJV)

2
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:25,000
O give thanks unto the LORD, for he is good: for his mercy endureth for ever.
Psalm 107:1 (KJV)

3
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:25,000
Every good gift and every perfect gift is from above, and cometh down from the Father of lights, with whom is no variableness, neither shadow of turning.
James 1:17 (KJV)

4
00:28:00,000 --> 00:28:25,000
Thou crownest the year with thy goodness; and thy paths drop fatness.
Psalm 65:11 (KJV)

5
00:37:00,000 --> 00:37:25,000
While the earth remaineth, seedtime and harvest, and cold and heat, and summer and winter, and day and night shall not cease.
Genesis 8:22 (KJV)

6
00:46:00,000 --> 00:46:25,000
Thou openest thine hand, and satisfiest the desire of every living thing.
Psalm 145:16 (KJV)

7
00:55:00,000 --> 00:55:25,000
It is of the LORD's mercies that we are not consumed, because his compassions fail not. They are new every morning: great is thy faithfulness.
Lamentations 3:22-23 (KJV)

8
01:04:00,000 --> 01:04:25,000
Bless the LORD, O my soul: and all that is within me, bless his holy name.
Psalm 103:1 (KJV)

9
01:13:00,000 --> 01:13:25,000
When thou hast eaten and art full, then thou shalt bless the LORD thy God for the good land which he hath given thee.
Deuteronomy 8:10 (KJV)

10
01:22:00,000 --> 01:22:25,000
For the LORD is good; his mercy is everlasting; and his truth endureth to all generations.
Psalm 100:5 (KJV)

11
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:25,000
Let us come before his presence with thanksgiving, and make a joyful noise unto him with psalms.
Psalm 95:2 (KJV)

12
01:40:00,000 --> 01:40:25,000
In every thing give thanks: for this is the will of God in Christ Jesus concerning you.
1 Thessalonians 5:18 (KJV)

13
01:49:00,000 --> 01:49:25,000
Be careful for nothing; but in every thing by prayer and supplication with thanksgiving let your requests be made known unto God.
Philippians 4:6 (KJV)

14
01:58:00,000 --> 01:58:25,000
I will praise thee, O LORD, with my whole heart; I will shew forth all thy marvellous works.
Psalm 9:1 (KJV)

15
02:07:00,000 --> 02:07:25,000
And let the peace of God rule in your hearts, to the which also ye are called in one body; and be ye thankful.
Colossians 3:15 (KJV)

16
02:16:00,000 --> 02:16:25,000
Oh that men would praise the LORD for his goodness, and for his wonderful works to the children of men!
Psalm 107:8 (KJV)

17
02:25:00,000 --> 02:25:25,000
This is the day which the LORD hath made; we will rejoice and be glad in it.
Psalm 118:24 (KJV)

18
02:34:00,000 --> 02:34:25,000
I will bless the LORD at all times: his praise shall continually be in my mouth.
Psalm 34:1 (KJV)

19
02:43:00,000 --> 02:43:25,000
O give thanks unto the LORD; for he is good: for his mercy endureth for ever.
Psalm 136:1 (KJV)

20
02:52:00,000 --> 02:52:25,000
Thanks be unto God for his unspeakable gift.
2 Corinthians 9:15 (KJV)

